   * still positioned correctly), it's purely a visibility toggle so the
   * compact card stays readable at small sizes. Full identification stays
   * available via tooltip (hover/focus) and the crawlable community list. */
  .is-compact .map-marker-label,
  .is-compact .map-marker-sublabel {
    display: none;
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
